hadiths[32]{hadithnumber,text}:
"884","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud se Alqama ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah ke sath tha. Phir use Usman Mina mein mile. To unhon ne kaha: Ae Abu Abd al-Rahman! Mujhe tum se ek hajat hai. Phir wo dono alag hue. Phir Usman ne kaha: Ae Abu Abd al-Rahman! Kya tumhe pasand hai ke hum tumhara kunwari se nikah kar dein jo tumhe wo yaad dilaye jo tum jante they? Phir jab Abdullah ne dekha ke use is ki hajat nahi to unhon ne meri taraf ishara kiya. Phir farmaya: Ae Alqama! Phir main un ke paas aaya jabke Wo farma rahe they: Suno! Agar tum ne ye kaha hai to beshak Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hum se farmaya: Ae naujawanon ki jamaat! Tum mein se jo istita'at rakhe use chahiye ke nikah kare. Aur jo istita'at na rakhe us par roza lazim hai, kyunke wo us ke liye dhal hai."
"885","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Teen giroh Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki biwiyon ke gharon ke paas aaye, Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki ibadat ke bare mein poochhte hue. Phir jab unhe khabar di gayi to goya unhon ne use kam samjha. Phir unhon ne kaha: Aur hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kahan? Aap ke agle aur pichhle gunah bakhsh diye gaye hain. Un mein se ek ne kaha: Raha main, beshak main hamesha raat mein namaz parhunga. Aur doosre ne kaha: Main zamana roza rakhunga aur iftar nahi karunga. Aur teesre ne kaha: Main aurton se alag rahunga aur kabhi nikah nahi karunga. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef laye aur farmaya: Kya tum ho jinhon ne aisa aur aisa kaha? Suno! Allah ki qasam! Beshak main tum mein Allah se sab se zyada darne wala aur Us se sab se zyada bachne wala hun. Lekin main roza rakhta hun aur iftar karta hun, namaz parhta hun aur sota hun, aur aurton se nikah karta hun. Phir jo meri sunnat se munh phere wo mujh se nahi."
"886","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Usman bin Maz'un ko tark-e-duniya se rok diya. Aur agar Aap unhe ijazat dete to hum khasi ho jate."
"887","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ladte they jabke hamare sath aurtein na thein. Phir hum ne kaha: Kya hum khasi na ho jayein? Phir Aap ne hamein is se mana farmaya. Phir Aap ne hamein is ke baad ijazat di ke hum aurat se kapde par nikah karein. Phir Aap ne parha [ae iman walo! Un paak cheezon ko haram na karo jo Allah ne tumhare liye halal ki hain]."
"888","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah aur Salama bin al-Akwa (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, un dono ne kaha: Hum lashkar mein they. Phir hamare paas Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka qasid aaya. Phir us ne kaha: Beshak tumhe ijazat di gayi hai ke tum faida uthao. Phir faida uthao."
"889","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar ke din aurton se mut'a se mana farmaya, aur paltu gadhon ke khane se."
"890","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aurat aur us ki phuphi ko jama na kiya jaye, na aurat aur us ki khala ko."
"891","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Maimuna se nikah kiya jabke Aap ehram bandhe they."
"892","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehte they: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mana farmaya ke tum mein se ek apne bhai ki bai par bai kare, aur mard apne bhai ke paigham par paigham bheje yahan tak ke pehla paigham dene wala chhor de ya paigham dene wala use ijazat de."
"893","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne shighar se mana farmaya. Shighar ye hai ke aadmi apni beti ka nikah is par kare ke doosra use apni beti ka nikah karaye, un dono ke darmiyan meher na ho."
"894","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Sharton mein sab se haqdar jisے tum poora karo wo hai jis se tum ne sharmgahein halal ki hain."
"895","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Bewa ka nikah na kiya jaye yahan tak ke us se mashwara liya jaye. Aur kunwari ka nikah na kiya jaye yahan tak ke us se ijazat li jaye. Unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Aur us ki ijazat kaise? Aap ne farmaya: Ye ke wo khamosh rahe."
"896","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya aurton se un ki sharmgahon ke bare mein mashwara liya jayega? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Main ne arz kiya: Beshak kunwari se mashwara liya jata hai to wo sharmati hai aur khamosh rehti hai. Aap ne farmaya: Us ki khamoshi us ki ijazat hai."
"897","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se nikah kiya jab main chhe saal ki thi. Phir hum Madina aaye aur Bani Harith bin Khazraj mein utre. Phir mujhe bukhar hua aur mere baal jhad gaye, phir kandhe tak ho gaye. Phir meri walida Umm Ruman mere paas aayein jabke main jhoole mein thi aur mere sath meri saheliyan thein. Phir unhon ne mujhe pukara. Phir main un ke paas aayi jabke main nahi janti thi wo mujh se kya chahti hain. Phir unhon ne mera hath pakda yahan tak ke mujhe ghar ke darwaze par khada kiya, jabke main haanp rahi thi yahan tak ke meri kuchh saans thehri. Phir unhon ne pani mein se kuchh liya aur us se mera chehra aur sar ponchha. Phir mujhe ghar mein dakhil kiya. Phir ghar mein Ansar ki aurtein thein. To unhon ne kaha: Bhalayi aur barkat par, aur achhe shagun par. Phir unhon ne mujhe unhe de diya. Phir unhon ne mera haal durust kiya. Phir mujhe sirf Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chasht mein daraya. Phir unhon ne mujhe Aap ke hawale kar diya, jabke main us din nau saal ki thi."
"898","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd al-Sa'idi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aurat Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Main aayi hun taake tumhe apni jaan hadiya karun. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ki taraf dekha. Phir nazar upar uthayi aur neeche ki. Phir apna sar jhukaya. Phir jab aurat ne dekha ke Aap ne us ke bare mein kuchh faisla nahi farmaya to wo baith gayi. Phir Aap ke sathiyon mein se ek shakhs khada hua aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Agar tumhe us ki hajat na ho to mujh se us ka nikah kar do. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhare paas koi cheez hai? Us ne arz kiya: Nahi, Allah ki qasam Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Apne ghar walon ke paas jao aur dekho kya tum koi cheez pate ho? Phir wo gaya phir lauta. Phir us ne arz kiya: Nahi, Allah ki qasam Ya Rasulullah! Main ne koi cheez nahi payi. Aap ne farmaya: Dekho agarche lohe ki angoothi ho. Phir wo gaya phir lauta. Phir us ne arz kiya: Nahi, Allah ki qasam Ya Rasulullah! Na lohe ki angoothi. Lekin ye mera tehband hai [Sahl ne kaha: Us ke paas chadar na thi]. Phir us ke liye us ka aadha hai. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum apne tehband se kya karoge? Agar tum ne use pehna to us par us mein se kuchh na hoga. Aur agar us ne use pehna to tum par kuchh na hoga. Phir wo shakhs baitha raha yahan tak ke us ki majlis lambi hui, phir khada hua. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use peeth pherte dekha to us ka hukm diya aur wo bulaya gaya. Phir jab wo aaya to Aap ne farmaya: Tumhare paas Quran mein se kya hai? Us ne arz kiya: Mere paas falan surat aur falan surat aur falan surat hai. Unhe gina. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum unhe zabani parhte ho? Us ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Jao, main ne use tumhari milkiyat mein de diya us se jo tumhare paas Quran mein se hai."
"899","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Abd al-Rahman bin Auf par zardi ka nishan dekha. Aap ne farmaya: Ye kya hai? Unhon ne arz kiya: Beshak main ne guthli ke wazan ke sone par ek aurat se nikah kiya hai. Aap ne farmaya: Allah tumhe barkat de. Walima karo agarche bakri se."
"900","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar par hamla kiya. Phir hum ne us ke paas andhere mein Fajr ki namaz parhi. Phir Nabiullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sawar hue, Abu Talha sawar hue, aur main Abu Talha ke peechhe sawar tha. Phir Nabiullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar ki gali mein daud lagayi, jabke mera ghutna Nabiullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki raan ko chhu raha tha. Phir Aap ne tehband apni raan se hataya yahan tak ke main Nabiullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki raan ki safedi dekh raha tha. Phir jab Aap basti mein dakhil hue to farmaya: Allahu Akbar! Khaibar kharab hua. Beshak jab hum kisi qaum ke maidan mein utarte hain to daraye gayon ki subah buri hoti hai. Aap ne ye teen martaba farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: Aur qaum apne kaamon ki taraf nikli. Phir unhon ne kaha: Muhammad aur lashkar [matlab fauj]. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum ne use zabardasti paya. Phir qaidi jama kiye gaye. Phir Dihya aaye aur arz kiya: Ya Nabiullah! Mujhe qaidiyon mein se londi dijiye. Aap ne farmaya: Jao aur londi lo. Phir unhon ne Safiyya bint Huyayy ko liya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas ek shakhs aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Nabiullah! Tum ne Dihya ko Safiyya bint Huyayy di, jo Quraiza aur Nadir ki sardar hain. Wo tumhare siwa kisi ke liye durust nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Use us ke sath bulao. Phir wo use lekar aaya. Phir jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usے dekha to farmaya: Qaidiyon mein se us ke siwa londi lo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use aazad farmaya aur us se nikah farmaya."
"901","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ki londi ho aur wo use pale aur us se acha sulook kare, phir use aazad kare aur us se nikah kare, us ke liye do ajr hain."
"902","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni biwiyon mein se kisi par utna walima na farmaya jitna Zainab par farmaya. Bakri se walima farmaya."
"903","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Zainab bint Jahsh se nikah kiya to Aap ne qaum ko bulaya. Phir unhon ne khaya. Phir wo baithe baatein karte rahe. Aur Aap goya uthne ke liye tayyar hue, phir wo na uthe. Phir jab Aap ne ye dekha to Aap khade hue. Phir jab Aap khade hue to jo khada hua khada hua, aur teen afrad baithe rahe. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) dakhil hone aaye to qaum baithi thi. Phir wo khade hue. Phir main chala aur aaya aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khabar di ke wo chale gaye. Phir Aap aaye yahan tak ke dakhil hue. Phir main dakhil hone laga to Aap ne mere aur apne darmiyan parda dal diya. Phir Allah ne ye nazil farmaya [ae iman walo! Nabi ke gharon mein dakhil na ho] ayat tak."
"904","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main logon mein parda ke bare mein sab se zyada janta hun. Ubayy bin Ka'b mujh se is ke bare mein poochhte they. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Zainab bint Jahsh se dulha bane subah ki, jabke Aap ne un se Madina mein nikah kiya tha. Phir Aap ne din chadhne ke baad khane ke liye logon ko bulaya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baithe, aur Aap ke sath mard baithe, qaum ke uthne ke baad, yahan tak ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khade hue. Phir Aap chale aur main Aap ke sath chala, yahan tak ke Aap Aisha ke hujre ke darwaze pahunche. Phir Aap ne gumaan kiya ke wo nikal gaye. Phir main Aap ke sath lauta to wo apni jagah baithe they. Phir Aap laute aur main doosri martaba Aap ke sath lauta yahan tak ke Aap Aisha ke hujre ke darwaze pahunche. Phir Aap laute aur main Aap ke sath lauta. Phir wo khade ho chuke they. Phir Aap ne mere aur apne darmiyan parda dala, aur parda nazil hua."
"905","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab Umm Sulaim ke pehluon se guzarte to un ke paas dakhil hote aur unhe salam farmate. Phir unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Zainab se dulha bane. Phir Umm Sulaim ne mujh se kaha: Kash hum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko hadiya dete. Phir main ne un se kaha: Karo. Phir unhon ne khajoor, ghee aur paneer ki taraf tawajjah ki. Phir handi mein hais banaya. Phir use mere sath Aap ki taraf bheja. Phir main use Aap ke paas lekar chala. To Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Use rakho. Phir Aap ne mujhe hukm diya. Phir farmaya: Mere liye mardon ko bulao jin ke naam liye, aur mere liye jise pao bulao. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne wo kiya jo Aap ne mujhe hukm farmaya tha. Phir main lauta to ghar apne walon se bhara tha. Phir main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha ke Aap ne apne dono hath us hais par rakhe. Aur us se jo Allah ne chaha farmaya. Phir Aap dus dus ko bulane lage jo us mein se khate, aur un se farmate: Allah ka naam lo, aur har shakhs apne samne se khaye. Unhon ne kaha: Yahan tak ke wo sab us se phat gaye. Phir un mein se jo nikla nikla, aur ek giroh baatein karte reh gaye. Unhon ne kaha: Aur main gham karne laga. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hujron ki taraf nikle, aur main Aap ke peechhe nikla. Phir main ne kaha: Beshak wo chale gaye. Phir Aap laute aur ghar mein dakhil hue aur parda gira diya, jabke main hujre mein tha. Jabke Wo farma rahe they: [ae iman walo! Nabi ke gharon mein dakhil na ho magar tumhe khane ki ijazat di jaye, us ke pakne ka intezar na karte hue. Lekin jab tumhe bulaya jaye to dakhil ho. Phir jab tum kha lo to muntashir ho jao aur baat ke liye uns na karo. Beshak ye Nabi ko takleef deta tha to Wo tum se sharmate they, jabke Allah haq se nahi sharmata]. Anas ne kaha: Beshak unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki dus saal khidmat ki."
"906","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ko walime ki taraf bulaya jaye to use chahiye ke aaye."
"907","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo kehte they: Bura khana walime ka khana hai, us ke liye ghani bulaye jate hain aur faqeer chhor diye jate hain. Aur jo dawat chhore us ne Allah aur Us ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki na-farmani ki."
"908","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rifa'a al-Qurazi ki biwi Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi aur arz kiya: Main Rifa'a ke paas thi. Phir us ne mujhe talaq di aur meri talaq poori ki. Phir main ne Abd al-Rahman bin al-Zubair se nikah kiya. Beshak us ke paas kapde ke kinare jaisa hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum chahti ho ke Rifa'a ki taraf lauto? Nahi, yahan tak ke tum us ki mithas chakho aur wo tumhari mithas chakhe. Aur Abu Bakr Aap ke paas baithe they, aur Khalid bin Sa'id bin al-Aas darwaze par ijazat ka intezar kar rahe they. Phir us ne kaha: Ae Abu Bakr! Kya tum nahi sunte isے jo wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas buland awaz se kehti hai?"
"909","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne apni biwi ko teen talaqein deen. Phir us ne nikah kiya, phir us ne talaq di. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha gaya: Kya wo pehle ke liye halal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, yahan tak ke wo us ki mithas chakhe jaisa pehle ne chakhi."
"910","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Suno! Agar un mein se ek apne ghar walon ke paas aate waqt kahe: Allah ke naam se. Ae Allah! Mujhe shaitan se door rakh aur shaitan ko us se door rakh jo Tune hamein diya. Phir un dono ke darmiyan is mein muqaddar kiya jaye, ya beta faisla kiya jaye, to use shaitan kabhi nuqsan nahi dega."
"911","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Yahood kehte they: Jab wo us se peechhe se mile to beta bhenga paida hota hai. Phir ye nazil hui [tumhari aurtein tumhari kheti hain. Phir apni kheti mein aao jahan se chaho]."
"912","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab aurat apne shohar ke bistar se munh pher kar raat guzare to farishte us par lanat karte hain yahan tak ke wo laute."
"913","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Bani Mustaliq ki ladayi mein nikle. Phir hum ne Arab ke qaidiyon mein se qaidi paye. Phir hum ne aurton ki khwahish ki, hum par kunwarapan sakht ho gaya, aur hum ne azl ko pasand kiya. Phir hum ne irada kiya ke azl karein. Aur hum ne kaha: Hum azl karte hain jabke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamare darmiyan hain, Aap se poochhne se pehle. Phir hum ne Aap se is ke bare mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum par kuchh nahi ke tum na karo. Qayamat ke din tak hone wali koi jaan nahi magar wo hone wali hai."
"914","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne qaidi paye aur hum azl karte. Phir hum ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya beshak tum karte ho? Aap ne ye teen martaba farmaya. Qayamat ke din tak hone wali koi jaan nahi magar wo hone wali hai."
"915","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum azl karte jabke Quran nazil ho raha tha."
